@FileApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5183

### Create a file record
POST {{FileApi_HostAddress}}/files
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "notes.txt",
  "sizeBytes": 120
}

### Get all
GET {{FileApi_HostAddress}}/files

### Get one by ID
GET {{FileApi_HostAddress}}/files/1

### Get one that doesn't exist
GET {{FileApi_HostAddress}}/files/99